    "stem": "（第 16 题第 (1) 问）计算：\\((3-\\pi)^0-2^{-1}+\\sqrt{\\dfrac14}\\)．",
    "answer": "\\(1\\)",
    "solution": "三项分别算：\\(3-\\pi\\ne0\\)，所以 \\((3-\\pi)^0=1\\)；\\(2^{-1}=\\dfrac12\\)；\\(\\sqrt{\\dfrac14}=\\dfrac12\\)。原式 \\(=1-\\dfrac12+\\dfrac12=1\\)。",
    "secs": [
      "j18-4"
    ],
    "prereq_secs": [
      "j8-1",
      "j16-2"
